narrative:
The Northern Reach envoy arrives beneath a flag patched so often its original blue is almost gone. Envoy Sera Vaun counts each guard at the gate before she speaks.

@Sera Vaun: I have come for words, not tribute. That distinction has become difficult for your court.

A black crow watches from the milestone. It does not move when the horses pass.

